  I had a funny experience with a wand of wishing while playing Nethack
using the remote server at storm.tamu.edu as Zoltar the wizard. (Incidentally
this exact character went on to get the #1 spot on the score list.)
SPOILERS FOLLOW:


  I was on my way back up from Hell with the Amulet in hand, having left the
Wizard paralyzed below.  I had two bags of holding: one cursed, the other
uncursed and full of stuff.  Much earlier I had made them as light as I had
wanted, using the well-known tricks.  However, I kept running into Liches
who would proceed to curse my full, uncursed bag; and uncurse my empty, cursed
one.  After transferring my items to the (newly) uncursed bag, it would
happen again.  After awhile, the bags were WAY too light, and I had to drop
them to fight.  I decided to use a charge on my wand of wishing to get some
ballast, as well as raw material for future gem production.  I had read in
the old spoiler file that one could wish for as many rocks as one wants.  I
found this to be untrue.  I wished for '10000 rocks'.  I ended up getting
' q- 8 rocks '.  I used up a WISH for EIGHT ROCKS.  Obviously it did not
ruin my game, but I thought it was pretty ironic.  Now I know how Charlie
Brown felt on Halloween.
  By the way, I was thinking that one way of accumulating scrolls could be
to send MAIL to yourself, and polymorph the scrolls of mail.  (I always
seem to run out of scrolls first on my big polypiling binges.)  Is there
any way to do this with Amiga nethack?  Thanks for your help.

